<p id='Extract'>Increasingly in the past few years, I have found walking to be
challenge. I have a hip replacement scheduled for next month. But in
the meantime, it's important for me to maintain (or rebuild) my
strength and endurance for the recovery. And so I accompanied the
family to a hidden waterfall on Kaua'i.</p>

<!-- ### Add-A-Page ### 5/28/2024 8:56:38 AM ### -->
	<p>The trip to Ho'opi'i Falls took less than an hour to make. Although
our route took us past Kaua'i's largest town, Lihue, most of it was
completeky scenic.</p>
	<p>Kauai's unique shape is a result of millions of years of volcanic
activity and erosion. As the oldest of the main Hawaiian Islands, it
was formed by the now-dormant Kauai volcano. Over time, the island
has been sculpted by wind, water, and the forces of nature, resulting
in its rugged terrain and dramatic cliffs.</p>
	<img src='20240525_110442.jpg' />

	<p>Interestingly, many visitors and locals note a resemblance between
Kauai and the rolling hills of Tuscany. This comparison often arises
from the island's verdant landscapes, agricultural fields, and
panoramic views. Both regions share a picturesque quality,
characterized by gentle hills, vibrant greenery, and a sense of
timeless natural beauty. While Kauai's tropical climate and
geological history are obviously distinct from Tuscany's
Mediterranean environment, the visual similarities can evoke a sense
of familiarity for those who have experienced the charm of both
places.</p>
	<img src='20240525_110445.jpg' />

	<p>There were just a few cars on the pavement near the trailhead.  There
are actually several trails heading down to the river; we took the
first we came to.</p>
	<img src='20240525_114951.jpg' />

	<p>I've been taking my daughter, Jenny, hiking since she could walk. I'm
so delighted she's passed that on to her kids. Nothing makes me
happier than seeing them be completely comfortable in nature.</p>
	<img src='20240525_115155.jpg' />

	<p>The Ho'opi'i Stream, also known as the Kapa'a Stream, plays a vital
role in the formation and sustenance of the Ho'opi'i Falls.
Originating from the highlands of Kauai, the stream meanders through
dense forests and valleys, contributing to the island's rich
ecosystem. Its journey is marked by the creation of two main
waterfalls, the upper and lower Ho'opi'i Falls, which offer serene
and scenic spots for visitors to enjoy. The stream's continuous flow
not only nourishes the surrounding flora and fauna but also shapes
the landscape, carving out paths through the volcanic rock over
centuries. The Ho'opi'i Stream's clear, cool waters are a refreshing
highlight for hikers and nature enthusiasts, providing a picturesque
and tranquil setting that encapsulates the natural beauty of Kauai.</p>
	<img src='20240525_120157.jpg' />
<img src='20240525_120815.jpg' />

	<p>I have a hip replacement coming up soon, so as difficult as walking
is for me, I believe it to be valuable in my upcoming recovery. Also,
grandson Zach found me a hiking stick, which helped a lot.</p>
	<img src='20240525_120816.jpg' />

	<p>This is Gianna, who can't wait to practice gymnastics at the falls.</p>
	<img src='20240525_121401.jpg' />

	<p>And here's  Dominic, who was so small on his last visit to Kaua'i he
doesn't really remember much of it.</p>
	<img src='20240525_121402.jpg' />
<img src='20240525_122135.jpg' />

	<p>And here's their mom, my daughter Jennifer, who can rock beach wear
like no one else!</p>
	<img src='20240525_122337.jpg' />

	<p>The upper Ho'opi'i Falls is a captivating sight nestled within the
lush forests of Kauai. This waterfall cascades gracefully over a
rocky ledge, creating a picturesque scene as the water tumbles into a
serene pool below. The falls are surrounded by a dense canopy of
tropical trees, adding to the secluded and tranquil atmosphere. The
rocks around the falls are often covered in a layer of moss,
enhancing the natural, untouched beauty of the area.</p><p>That's
grandson Zach, who I caught in mid-jump. (And you thought he was
levitating!)</p>
	<img src='20240525_122522.jpg' />

	<p>Young Dominic took a little time to get up his nerve. But I was so
pleased to note that no one pushed or urged him to do it; it was all
him.</p>
	<img src='20240525_122557.jpg' />
<img src='20240525_122558.jpg' />

	<p>Gianna (who is actually a gymnast) went for height <i>and</i>
distance.</p>
	<img src='20240525_122621.jpg' />

	<p>And even Mommy got into the act!</p>
	<img src='20240525_122622.jpg' />

	<p>Back for more.</p>
	<img src='20240525_123608.jpg' />

	<p>The pool at the base of the falls is a popular spot for visitors to
take a refreshing dip. Adventurous souls often climb the surrounding
rocks to jump into the cool, inviting waters below.</p>
	<img src='20240525_123726.jpg' />
<img src='20240525_123735.jpg' />
<img src='20240525_123743.jpg' />

	<p>One of the most charming and curious sights on Kauai is the abundance
of wild roosters. These colorful birds are everywhere, from the
beaches to the forests, and Ho'opi'i Falls is no exception. The
roosters, along with hens and chicks, roam freely, adding a vibrant
splash of color and a bit of lively noise to the natural scenery.
Their origins trace back to hurricanes in the early 1990s, which
destroyed domestic coops and allowed these birds to thrive in the
wild.</p>
	<img src='20240525_123845.jpg' />
<img src='20240525_125156.jpg' />

	<p>I suppose one can only cliff jump so much before it gets old.
Luckily, the stream above the falls is also lovely, and awesome for a
kid to explore.</p>
